<section class="matrix-panel" data-matrix>
 <div><canvas width="900" height="600" aria-label="Horn torus with equal major and minor radii and a shared central infinity point">Horn torus: x = (1 + cos v) cos u; y = sin v; z = (1 + cos v) sin u. At v = pi every longitude meets at the origin.</canvas><p class="small-copy">Source-defined geometry, not generated artwork. R = r. The surface meets at the infinity point.</p></div>
 <div class="matrix-controls"><h3>Explore an address</h3><label>Shell <select data-shell>{Array.from({length:7},(_,i)=><option value={i+1}>Shell {i+1}</option>)}</select></label><label>Side <select data-side><option value="outside">Outside</option><option value="inside">Inside</option></select></label><label>Row <input data-row type="range" min="1" max="12" value="3"/></label><label>Column <input data-column type="range" min="1" max="24" value="6"/></label><label>View angle <input data-angle type="range" min="-70" max="70" value="25"/></label><output data-address aria-live="polite"></output><button class="button" data-reset-matrix>Reset view</button><p class="small-copy">12 × 24 = 288 facets.<br/>7 shells × 2 sides × 288 = 4,032 addresses.<br/>Shell and side choose an address; the display shows one shell.</p></div>
</section>
<script src="../scripts/matrix.js"></script>
